 "case": "figures",
 "about": "Sample content for the deck sample tool (apps/studio/categories/sample.py), invented people, organisations and figures only. prompt is the customer’s one message; slots holds, per part id, the model’s answer for each time that slot appears. Past its listed instances a repeating slot is drawn as the honest form (heading and ruled lines). A slot whose heading is fixed carries an empty heading, which the finish writes in the language of the deck. Customer slots hold only what the prompt says (figures) or an honest form (topic_only); notes are left to the real model.",
 "prompt": {
  "uz": "Oylik yig‘ilishga 7 ta slayd: mening oziq-ovqat do‘konimning oktyabr hisoboti. Savdo, mln so‘m: avgust 365, sentabr 380, oktyabr 412 (reja 400). Xaridorlar 5 800 nafar (sentabrda 5 300). Yaxshi ketdi: yangi non peshtaxtasi; sut mahsulotlari savdosi oshdi. Muammo bo‘ldi: sut yetkazib berish 4 marta kechikdi; 2 nafar sotuvchi ishdan ketdi. Noyabr rejasi: savdo 430 mln so‘m, 2 ta yangi sotuvchi qabul qilish. Savdoni diagramma qilib ko‘rsating.",
  "ru": "Нужно 7 слайдов для ежемесячного собрания: отчёт за октябрь моего продуктового магазина. Продажи, млн сумов: август 365, сентябрь 380, октябрь 412 (план 400). Покупателей 5 800 (в сентябре 5 300). Получилось: новая хлебная витрина; выросли продажи молочных продуктов. Проблемы: молоко привозили с опозданием 4 раза; ушли 2 продавца. План на ноябрь: продажи 430 млн сумов, принять 2 новых продавцов. Продажи покажите диаграммой.",
  "en": "7 slides for the monthly meeting: October report of my grocery shop. Sales, m sum: August 365, September 380, October 412 (plan 400). Customers 5,800 (September 5,300). Went well: the new bread counter; dairy sales rose. Problems: milk deliveries were late 4 times; 2 shop assistants left. November plan: sales of 430 m sum, hire 2 new shop assistants. Show the sales as a chart."
 },
